      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNSET SQUASHY (1) flew the lids from the middle with a slick turn of foot before finishing second (19.76) and beaten 2.25 lengths over 352m at Q Lakeside. Deserves a win and gets his chance. KING'S SHADOW (4) has missed the frame at his last couple but wasn't beaten far three back when third (19.39) at this track in a Grade 5. Key player on best and worth another try. ATOMIC TIGER (2) held a forward position from the pinch but began to paddle on the bend and drifted out of the finish when 8th at Townsville in OPEN company. Can do much better this time. AUTOFOCUS (5) is in winning form and worth including in the main hopes.",
